# `bun run provision` installs a different store ID in each Vercel environment.
# `vercel env pull` supplies the development store ID and Vercel-issued OIDC token.
BLOB_STORE_ID=
# Optional server-only override; production default is tracked in lib/auth.ts.
# Preview may use the same identity service while its Blob store stays isolated.
ORRERY_COLLECTOR_ORIGIN=https://microcosm-telemetry-389282473430.us-central1.run.app
